            "text": "合体後の角振動数は \\(\\sqrt{k/(M+m)}\\) です。合体時刻に、一体後の半周期を加えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "t=\\frac\\pi6\\sqrt{\\frac{M}{k}}+\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{M+m}{k}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a-p06-main",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "解答",
            "text": "A 問1: 1 ③／A 問2: 2 ⑥／A 問3: 3 ②／B 問4: 4 ①／B 問5: 5 ⑤／B 問6: 6 ⑦",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "juntendo-2025-general-a-physics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Ⅰ 第3問　解説",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "A　粒子の運動",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "|\\Delta p|=2mv\\cos\\theta,\\qquad \\text{衝突回数}=\\frac{v}{2r\\cos\\theta}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "1回の力積と1秒あたりの衝突回数を掛けると、入射角は消えます。さらに \\(N\\) 粒子へ平均し、球面積で割ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p=\\frac{Nm\\overline{v^2}}{4\\pi r^3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "B　光子の運動",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2\\frac{hf}{c}\\cos\\theta\\cdot\\frac{c}{2r\\cos\\theta}=\\frac{hf}{r}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a-p07-main",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "juntendo-2025-general-a-physics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p=\\frac{Nh\\bar f}{4\\pi r^3},\\qquad E=Nh\\bar f,\\qquad V=\\frac43\\pi r^3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{E}{V}=3p",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Ⅱ　解答・解説",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問1　磁束変化",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=x^2\\tan\\theta,\\qquad \\Delta S=2xv\\tan\\theta\\,\\Delta t",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\Delta\\Phi=2Bxv\\tan\\theta\\,\\Delta t",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問2　誘導電流",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V=2Bxv\\tan\\theta,\\qquad R=2\\sigma x\\tan\\theta,\\qquad I=\\frac{Bv}{\\sigma}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a-p08-main",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "juntendo-2025-general-a-physics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問3　磁気力と係数「あ」",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "F=IB\\cdot2x\\tan\\theta=\\frac{2B^2xv\\tan\\theta}{\\sigma}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "m\\Delta v+\\frac{2B^2\\tan\\theta}{\\sigma}xv\\Delta t=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\text{あ}=\\frac{2B^2\\tan\\theta}{\\sigma}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問4（a）（b）保存量と停止位置",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "mv+\\frac{B^2\\tan\\theta}{\\sigma}x^2=mv_0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "v=v_0-\\frac{B^2\\tan\\theta}{m\\sigma}x^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x_f=\\frac1B\\sqrt{\\frac{m\\sigma v_0}{\\tan\\theta}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問4（c）ジュール熱",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "原本の主解法どおり、金属棒の運動エネルギーの減少をジュール熱とします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "Q=\\frac{m}{2}(v_0^2-v^2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "Q=\\frac{B^2\\tan\\theta}{2\\sigma}x^2\\left(2v_0-\\frac{B^2\\tan\\theta}{m\\sigma}x^2\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a-p09-main",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "juntendo-2025-general-a-physics-answers-p010",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "原本の別解",
            "text": "ジュール熱を \\(Q=\\int IV\\,dt\\) から求める方法も示されています。\\(v=dx/dt\\) を使って時間積分を位置積分へ変換し、問4（a）の速度式を代入します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "Q=\\frac{2B^2\\tan\\theta}{\\sigma}\\int_0^x x'v\\,dx'",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "Q=\\frac{B^2\\tan\\theta}{2\\sigma}x^2\\left(2v_0-\\frac{B^2\\tan\\theta}{m\\sigma}x^2\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a-p10-main",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "juntendo-2025-general-a-physics-answers-p011",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "講評からの学習ポイント",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "原本講評は、大問2題で標準的だが全問を時間内に解き切るのは難しいとしています。Ⅰは短い標準小問を先に確保し、第2問の長い式変形は見極めます。Ⅱは前半を教科書公式で確保し、後半は問題文の誘導に沿って保存量を作るのが主経路です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
